# Dataset

This project uses the NASA C-MAPSS turbofan engine degradation dataset, including subsets FD001, FD002, FD003, and FD004.

The dataset is not included in this repository due to file-size limitations.

Place the following files in this folder before running the project:

- train_FD001.txt
- test_FD001.txt
- RUL_FD001.txt
- train_FD002.txt
- test_FD002.txt
- RUL_FD002.txt
- train_FD003.txt
- test_FD003.txt
- RUL_FD003.txt
- train_FD004.txt
- test_FD004.txt
- RUL_FD004.txt
